          "source": "Tatoeba #946124 @riccioberto / #2852399 @Balamax (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/946124",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "corre-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5486535",
          "text": "Il cavallo corre velocemente.",
          "translation": "Лошадь быстро бегает.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5486535 @dnnywld / #5485114 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5486535",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "corre-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5539650",
          "text": "Tom corre 10 km al giorno.",
          "translation": "Том бегает по 10 км в день.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5539650 @dnnywld / #5539647 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5539650",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "corre-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
