          "translation": "Она захлопнула дверь.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #382912 @ver / #1711412 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/382912",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sbattuto-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5632244",
          "text": "Hi sbattuto i piedi sul pavimento.",
          "translation": "Я постукивал ногой по полу.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5632244 @dnnywld / #5631104 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5632244",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sbattuto-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6160328",
          "text": "Ho sbattuto il gomito contro il muro.",
          "translation": "Я ударился локтем об стену.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6160328 @dnnywld / #5742877 @Wezel (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6160328",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sbattuto-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5527576",
          "text": "Lui ha sbattuto la faccia sul pavimento.",
          "translation": "Он грохнулся лицом об пол.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5527576 @dnnywld / #5527523 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5527576",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sbattuto-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": null,
        "singular": "sbattuto",
        "plural": "",
