          "translation": "Со сколькими политиками ты лично знаком?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5982398 @dnnywld / #5982185 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5982398",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
