          "source": "Tatoeba #5616460 @dnnywld / #4215954 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5616460",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "metterò-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6689900",
          "text": "Non mi metterò a supplicarti.",
          "translation": "Я не стану умолять тебя.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6689900 @dnnywld / #6689722 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6689900",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
