          "source": "Tatoeba #6367820 @dnnywld / #6366907 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6367820",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "lunghe-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7006477",
          "text": "Meglio un Khinkali di lunghe conversazioni.",
          "translation": "Чем долгие разговоры, лучше хинкал.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7006477 @dnnywld / #7005054 @AqQoyriq_1 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7006477",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "lunghe-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6872016",
          "text": "Non ha senso andare per le lunghe.",
          "translation": "Тянуть дальше нет смысла.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6872016 @dnnywld / #4238531 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6872016",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "lunghe-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2790666",
          "text": "Perché i conigli hanno le orecchie lunghe?",
          "translation": "Почему у кроликов длинные уши?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2790666 @Guybrush88 / #2790410 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2790666",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "lunghe-adj"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
