          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "correte-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6857354",
          "text": "Siete degli ignoranti: invece di aiutare, correte e vi nascondete.",
          "translation": "Вы бараны: вместо того, чтобы помочь, бегаете, прячетесь.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6857354 @dnnywld / #4792527 @AqQoyriq_1 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6857354",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "correte-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
