          "text": "Sono giapponesi o cinesi?",
          "translation": "Они японцы или китайцы?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1664789 @Guybrush88 / #984639 @saiko (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1664789",
