          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "seminterrato-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5428987",
          "text": "Nel garage del seminterrato si sono scontrate due macchine.",
          "translation": "В подземном гараже столкнулись две машины.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5428987 @dnnywld / #5428507 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5428987",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "seminterrato-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "10911258",
          "text": "Il seminterrato di Sami era di fatto una camera delle torture.",
          "translation": "Подвал Сами фактически был камерой пыток.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10911258 @dnnywld / #10911076 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10911258",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "seminterrato-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
