          "id": "5484159",
          "text": "Chi ha stabilito queste regole?",
          "translation": "Кто установил эти правила?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5484159 @dnnywld / #5483902 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5484159",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
