          "text": "Chi ha stabilito queste regole?",
          "translation": "Кто установил эти правила?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5484159 @dnnywld / #5483902 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5484159",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "stabilito-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6810639",
          "text": "La autorità hanno stabilito diversamente.",
          "translation": "Начальство рассудило иначе.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6810639 @dnnywld / #4081318 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6810639",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "stabilito-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5593393",
          "text": "Non abbiamo ancora stabilito la data.",
          "translation": "Мы ещё не назначили дату.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5593393 @dnnywld / #5593348 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5593393",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "stabilito-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5619404",
          "text": "C'è qualche posto stabilito per questo libro?",
          "translation": "Есть для этой книги какое-нибудь определённое место?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5619404 @dnnywld / #3045852 @sharptoothed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5619404",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "stabilito-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5504915",
          "text": "Lui ha infranto il suo record personale stabilito cinque anni fa.",
          "translation": "Он побил свой собственный рекорд пятилетней давности.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5504915 @dnnywld / #5504496 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5504915",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "stabilito-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
