          "text": "All'allenamento indosserò la tua tuta viola?",
          "translation": "Я надену на тренировку твой фиолетовый спортивный костюм?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5476803 @dnnywld / #5475810 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5476803",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "viola-name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5536437",
          "text": "Il viola è il miglior colore al mondo!",
          "translation": "Пурпурный — лучший в мире цвет!",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5536437 @dnnywld / #5535862 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5536437",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "viola-name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5507070",
          "text": "Sei anche capace di suonare la viola, o solo il violino?",
          "translation": "А ты на альте играть тоже умеешь, или только на скрипке?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5507070 @dnnywld / #3603312 @Shady_arc (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5507070",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "viola-name"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": "f",
        "singular": "la Viola",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": ""
      }
