          "text": "Questa macchina fa 100 copie al minuto.",
          "translation": "Этот аппарат делает 100 копий в минуту.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1546570 @Guybrush88 / #3451385 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1546570",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "copie-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "10959599",
          "text": "Più di dieci milioni di copie della canzone sono state vendute.",
          "translation": "Было продано более десяти миллионов копий песни.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10959599 @dnnywld / #10958189 @Wezel (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10959599",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "copie-noun"
          ]
