        {
          "id": "10856374",
          "text": "La vaccinazione diventerà obbligatoria?",
          "translation": "Станет ли вакцинация обязательной?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10856374 @dnnywld / #10144989 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10856374",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "diventerà-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3557127",
          "text": "Penso che Tom non diventerà mai famoso.",
          "translation": "Думаю, Том никогда не прославится.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3557127 @Guybrush88 / #5392434 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3557127",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "diventerà-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6874721",
          "text": "Tom spera che suo figlio diventerà un avvocato.",
          "translation": "Том надеется, что его сын станет адвокатом.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6874721 @dnnywld / #6874624 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6874721",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "diventerà-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": null,
        "singular": "diventerà",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": "diventerà"
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "banche-noun",
      "lemma": "banche",
      "pos": "noun",
      "language": "it",
      "cefr_level": "C1",
      "frequency_rank": 5480,
      "frequency_band": "celi-c1",
      "translations": {},
      "gender": "f",
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "10878725",
          "text": "Sono un rapinatore di banche.",
          "translation": "Я граблю банки.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10878725 @dnnywld / #5314479 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10878725",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "banche-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7657158",
          "text": "Non vai a costruire banche in Etiopia?",
          "translation": "Вы не собираетесь строить банки в Эфиопии?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7657158 @Guybrush88 / #13651433 @Qvadratus (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7657158",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "banche-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7657266",
          "text": "Non va a costruire banche in Arabia Saudita?",
          "translation": "Он не собирается строить банки в Саудовской Аравии?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7657266 @Guybrush88 / #10427236 @Balamax (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7657266",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "banche-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6894928",
          "text": "La maggior parte delle grandi banche sta introducendo questo sistema.",
          "translation": "Большинство крупных банков вводят эту систему.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6894928 @dnnywld / #3420212 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6894928",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "banche-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5683470",
          "text": "Le banche derubano le persone e le persone rapinano le banche.",
          "translation": "Банки грабят людей, а люди грабят банки.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5683470 @dnnywld / #5683462 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5683470",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "banche-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": "f",
        "singular": "la banche",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "pozzo-noun",
      "lemma": "pozzo",
      "pos": "noun",
      "language": "it",
      "cefr_level": "C1",
      "frequency_rank": 5481,
      "frequency_band": "celi-c1",
      "translations": {},
      "gender": "m",
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "1113341",
          "text": "Non c'è acqua nel pozzo.",
          "translation": "В колодце нет воды.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1113341 @Guybrush88 / #1428819 @Balamax (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1113341",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pozzo-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5392514",
          "text": "Il bambino è caduto nel pozzo.",
          "translation": "Ребёнок упал в колодец.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5392514 @dnnywld / #5392414 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5392514",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pozzo-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5998830",
          "text": "Tom calò il secchio nel pozzo.",
          "translation": "Том опустил ведро в колодец.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5998830 @dnnywld / #4281767 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5998830",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pozzo-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "10772611",
          "text": "Tom fece scendere il secchio nel pozzo.",
          "translation": "Том спустил ведро в колодец.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10772611 @dnnywld / #3189792 @averoes (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10772611",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pozzo-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5766773",
          "text": "Laggiù, in fondo al pozzo, c'è qualcuno.",
          "translation": "Там, внизу, на дне колодца, кто-то есть.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5766773 @dnnywld / #5766738 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5766773",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pozzo-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": "m",
        "singular": "il pozzo",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": ""
      }
    },
