          "id": "5691409",
          "text": "Lui dimostra la sua età.",
          "translation": "Он выглядит на свой возраст.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5691409 @dnnywld / #5691059 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5691409",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "dimostra-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13612817",
          "text": "Questo dimostra che sei un bugiardo.",
          "translation": "Это доказывает, что ты лжец.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13612817 @dnnywld / #6391501 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13612817",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "dimostra-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3151660",
          "text": "Questo dimostra che sono più giovani di noi!",
          "translation": "Это доказывает, что они моложе нас!",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3151660 @Guybrush88 / #3151670 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3151660",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "dimostra-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6004682",
          "text": "Colui che si scusa senza che sia necessario, dimostra la sua colpevolezza.",
          "translation": "Тот, кто извиняется без необходимости, подтверждает свою вину.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6004682 @dnnywld / #6004057 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6004682",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "dimostra-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": null,
        "singular": "dimostra",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": "dimostra"
      }
    },
    {
      "slug": "noia-noun",
      "lemma": "noia",
      "pos": "noun",
      "language": "it",
      "cefr_level": "C1",
      "frequency_rank": 5530,
      "frequency_band": "celi-c1",
      "translations": {},
      "gender": "f",
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "5452682",
          "text": "Che noia. Cosa fare?",
          "translation": "Скучно. Чем бы заняться?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5452682 @dnnywld / #1496482 @Evgeniy (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5452682",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "noia-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6961199",
          "text": "Il cibo del luogo viene velocemente a noia.",
          "translation": "Здешняя еда быстро приедается.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6961199 @dnnywld / #6960689 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6961199",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "noia-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6967713",
          "text": "Tutto ciò che intraprendo mi va a noia rapidamente.",
          "translation": "Все, за что я берусь, мне быстро надоедает.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6967713 @dnnywld / #745615 @nadya (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6967713",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "noia-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5481762",
          "text": "Quando Tom parla del suo lavoro io muoio di noia.",
          "translation": "Когда Том рассказывает о своей работе, я умираю от скуки.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5481762 @dnnywld / #5480580 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5481762",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "noia-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": "f",
        "singular": "la noia",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": ""
      }
    },
