          "id": "5692400",
          "text": "\"I maiali hanno i peli?\" - \"No, i maiali hanno la setola\".",
          "translation": "\"У свиньи есть шерсть?\" - \"Не, у свиньи щетина\".",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5692400 @dnnywld / #5689654 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5692400",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "peli-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": null,
        "singular": "peli",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": "peli"
