          "id": "4596508",
          "text": "Ecco la mia ricevuta.",
          "translation": "Вот моя квитанция.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4596508 @Guybrush88 / #5656450 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4596508",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ricevuta-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5677826",
          "text": "Non l'abbiamo ricevuta.",
          "translation": "Мы её не получили.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5677826 @dnnywld / #5677389 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5677826",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ricevuta-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "10910085",
          "text": "Non l'ho mai ricevuta.",
          "translation": "Я её так и не получил.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10910085 @dnnywld / #10378201 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10910085",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ricevuta-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5547787",
          "text": "Ricevuta questa lettera, la bruciò senza leggerla.",
          "translation": "Получив это письмо, он сжёг его, не читая.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5547787 @dnnywld / #5547097 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5547787",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ricevuta-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5780728",
          "text": "Ricevuta la notiza, la donna cercò di suicidarsi.",
          "translation": "Получив известие, женщина попыталась покончить с собой.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5780728 @dnnywld / #5779031 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5780728",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ricevuta-adj"
          ]
        }
      ],
