          "id": "12850042",
          "text": "Il cuore non si comanda.",
          "translation": "Насильно мил не будешь.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12850042 @Bernie75 / #3207792 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12850042",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
