          "source": "Tatoeba #12850043 @Bernie75 / #3207792 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12850043",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "comanda-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "12870560",
          "text": "Comanda i tuoi desideri, ma obbedisci alla tua coscienza.",
          "translation": "Будь воли своей хозяином, совести же своей - рабом.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12870560 @Bernie75 / #2521056 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12870560",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
