          "source": "Tatoeba #10853815 @dnnywld / #3515011 @corvard (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10853815",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "vomito-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6691614",
          "text": "A volte nel vomito del mio gatto noto dei fili d'erba.",
          "translation": "Иногда в блевотине моей кошки я замечаю травинки.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6691614 @dnnywld / #6690932 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6691614",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
