          "text": "Gli squali sono pericolosi?",
          "translation": "Акулы опасны?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10849803 @dnnywld / #4633719 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10849803",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
