          "translation": "Я в пижаме.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5601493 @dnnywld / #5601302 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5601493",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pigiama-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7633792",
          "text": "Ho indossato il pigiama.",
          "translation": "Я надел пижаму.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7633792 @dnnywld / #7633567 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7633792",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pigiama-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "828750",
          "text": "Ho fatto colazione in pigiama.",
          "translation": "Я позавтракал в пижаме.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #828750 @riccioberto / #580410 @al_ex_an_der (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/828750",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pigiama-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6978327",
          "text": "Indosso un pigiama di flanella.",
          "translation": "Я ношу фланелевую пижаму.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6978327 @dnnywld / #5728199 @Wezel (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6978327",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pigiama-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5428385",
          "text": "Il pigiama si trova sul letto.",
          "translation": "Пижама лежит на кровати.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5428385 @dnnywld / #5428205 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5428385",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pigiama-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": "m",
        "singular": "il pigiama",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": ""
      }
