          "text": "Chi ha trascinato qui questo cassettone?",
          "translation": "Кто сюда притащил этот комод?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6901750 @dnnywld / #6899693 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6901750",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
