      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "6908226",
          "text": "Ogni pianta viene usata per scopi diversi.",
          "translation": "Каждое растение используется в различных целях.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6908226 @dnnywld / #6907985 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6908226",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
