          "source": "Tatoeba #6879477 @dnnywld / #5681402 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6879477",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "recita-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1969888",
          "text": "Jane recita nei film da quando aveva undici anni.",
          "translation": "Джейн снимается в кино с одиннадцати лет.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1969888 @Guybrush88 / #6911323 @fjay69 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1969888",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "recita-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5968713",
          "text": "La prima regola di Internet recita: non leggete i commenti.",
