          "text": "Tom ti ha infranto il cuore?",
          "translation": "Том разбил тебе сердце?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5504399 @dnnywld / #5503525 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5504399",
