          "text": "Lui li prendeva per il naso.",
          "translation": "Он водил их за нос.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6903387 @dnnywld / #4509299 @sharptoothed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6903387",
