          "source": "Tatoeba #6939762 @dnnywld / #6939500 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6939762",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "vinci-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6939760",
          "text": "La \"Monna Lisa\" fu dipinta da Leonardo da Vinci.",
          "translation": "\"Мона Лиза\" была написана Леонардо да Винчи.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6939760 @dnnywld / #6939500 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6939760",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
