          "source": "Tatoeba #5692306 @dnnywld / #5691669 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5692306",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "professione-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7779378",
          "text": "Qual è la sua professione?",
