          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "esperienze-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5474631",
          "text": "Mia moglie non condivide con me le sue esperienze.",
          "translation": "Моя жена не делится со мной своими переживаниями.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5474631 @dnnywld / #5308320 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5474631",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
