          "source": "Tatoeba #3480918 @Guybrush88 / #598013 @Disconnect (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3480918",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "guidando-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2450606",
          "text": "Stai guidando come un pazzo!",
