          "source": "Tatoeba #6953117 @dnnywld / #6952829 @Wezel (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6953117",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "particolari-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6963748",
          "text": "I suoi dipinti non hanno prezzi particolari.",
          "translation": "Его картины не имеют особой цены.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6963748 @dnnywld / #6963163 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6963748",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "particolari-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "11242318",
          "text": "Non potreste raccontare con più dovizia di particolari?",
          "translation": "Вы не могли бы рассказать поподробнее?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #11242318 @dnnywld / #11242304 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/11242318",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "particolari-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
