          "source": "Tatoeba #5491934 @dnnywld / #5491840 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5491934",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "elemento-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5492181",
          "text": "L'azoto è un elemento chimico contrassegnato dal simbolo N.",
          "translation": "Азот — химический элемент, который обозначается символом N.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5492181 @dnnywld / #5491875 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5492181",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "elemento-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5491958",
          "text": "L'argon è un elemento chimico contrassegnato dal simbolo Ar.",
          "translation": "Аргон — химический элемент, который обозначается символом Ar.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5491958 @dnnywld / #5491823 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5491958",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "elemento-noun"
          ]
        }
