          "translation": "Я слегка голоден.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1266015 @Guybrush88 / #2419444 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1266015",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "affamato-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6685231",
          "text": "Il cane è affamato.",
          "translation": "Собака голодная.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6685231 @dnnywld / #6685003 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6685231",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "affamato-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6219141",
          "text": "Sei affamato anche tu?",
          "translation": "Ты тоже голодный?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6219141 @dnnywld / #6218146 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6219141",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "affamato-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6363489",
          "text": "Non sono ancora affamato.",
          "translation": "Я ещё не проголодался.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6363489 @dnnywld / #6363095 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6363489",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "affamato-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6906086",
          "text": "Devi essere molto affamato.",
          "translation": "Ты, наверное, очень есть хочешь.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6906086 @dnnywld / #6905810 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6906086",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
