          "id": "13779191",
          "text": "È tutto fiato sprecato.",
          "translation": "А вот это уже ни к чему.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13779191 @dnnywld / #5305075 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13779191",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sprecato-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4439",
          "text": "Non c'è amore sprecato.",
