          "translation": "Мы её не строили.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5556480 @dnnywld / #5556476 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5556480",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "costruita-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5482162",
          "text": "La casa fu costruita nel XVI secolo.",
          "translation": "Дом был построен в XVI веке.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5482162 @dnnywld / #5481935 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5482162",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "costruita-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7003032",
          "text": "La lingua russa è tutta costruita su sfumature.",
          "translation": "Русский язык весь построен на нюансах.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7003032 @dnnywld / #6547253 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7003032",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "costruita-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6024971",
          "text": "La cabina dell'ascensore è costruita in acciaio.",
          "translation": "Кабина лифта сделана из стали.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6024971 @dnnywld / #6024925 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6024971",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "costruita-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3030501",
          "text": "La casa è stata costruita agli inizi del secolo.",
          "translation": "Дом построили в начале века.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3030501 @al_ex_an_der / #3030500 @al_ex_an_der (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3030501",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "costruita-adj"
          ]
