          "translation": "Он любит джаз, и я тоже.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5654843 @dnnywld / #5654726 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5654843",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
