        },
        {
          "id": "3696594",
          "text": "Cosa fanno i pompieri quando non ci sono incendi?",
          "translation": "Что делают пожарные, когда нет пожаров?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3696594 @Guybrush88 / #4592682 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3696594",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pompieri-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2827888",
          "text": "I pompieri mettono sempre in pericolo la loro vita.",
          "translation": "Пожарные всегда подвергают свою жизнь опасности.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2827888 @Guybrush88 / #4281842 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2827888",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pompieri-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3696595",
