          "text": "Questo è un sapone detergente.",
          "translation": "Это очищающее мыло.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1671678 @Guybrush88 / #3148203 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1671678",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sapone-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6942756",
          "text": "Tom fa le bolle di sapone.",
          "translation": "Том пускает мыльные пузыри.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6942756 @dnnywld / #6941843 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6942756",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sapone-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5403841",
          "text": "Noi laviamo le mani col sapone.",
          "translation": "Мы моем руки с мылом.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5403841 @dnnywld / #5143180 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5403841",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sapone-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6942755",
          "text": "La bolla di sapone è scoppiata.",
          "translation": "Мыльный пузырь лопнул.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6942755 @dnnywld / #6941842 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6942755",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sapone-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
