          "id": "5509603",
          "text": "Sto offrendo un lavoro a Tom.",
          "translation": "Я предлагаю Тому работу.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5509603 @dnnywld / #5508962 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5509603",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "offrendo-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6922979",
          "text": "Mi basta la metà di ciò che stai offrendo.",
          "translation": "Мне хватит и половины того, что ты предлагаешь.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6922979 @dnnywld / #6922731 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6922979",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "offrendo-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5484111",
          "text": "Ti sto offrendo la possibilità di trovare la felicità.",
          "translation": "Я даю тебе возможность обрести счастье.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5484111 @dnnywld / #5483974 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5484111",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "offrendo-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6956613",
          "text": "Tom mi sta offrendo di cominciare un'attività congiunta.",
          "translation": "Том предлагает мне начать совместный бизнес.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6956613 @dnnywld / #6956182 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6956613",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "offrendo-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": null,
        "singular": "offrendo",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": "offrendo"
      }
