    {
      "slug": "digitali-adj",
      "lemma": "digitali",
      "pos": "adj",
      "language": "it",
      "cefr_level": "C1",
      "frequency_rank": 7144,
      "frequency_band": "celi-c1",
      "translations": {},
      "gender": "m",
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "4420599",
          "text": "Molti sistemi biometrici si basano sul lettore di impronte digitali.",
          "translation": "В основе многих биометрических систем лежит сканер отпечатков пальцев.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4420599 @al_ex_an_der / #4420581 @al_ex_an_der (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4420599",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "digitali-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5440335",
          "text": "Guarda che stupefacente coincidenza! Tom ha le mie stesse impronte digitali.",
          "translation": "Смотри, какое потрясающее совпадение! У Тома такие же отпечатки пальцев, как у меня.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5440335 @dnnywld / #5440213 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5440335",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "digitali-adj"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": "m",
        "singular": "il digitali",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": ""
      }
    },
