          "text": "Non siamo arrabbiati.",
          "translation": "Мы не сердимся.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4237638 @Guybrush88 / #5491992 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4237638",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "arrabbiati-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3266609",
          "text": "Loro erano arrabbiati.",
          "translation": "Они были сердиты.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3266609 @Guybrush88 / #3266610 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3266609",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "arrabbiati-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4237671",
          "text": "Non eravamo arrabbiati.",
          "translation": "Мы не были сердиты.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4237671 @Guybrush88 / #4448728 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4237671",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "arrabbiati-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2415171",
          "text": "Per cosa siete arrabbiati?",
          "translation": "Чем вы расстроены?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2415171 @Guybrush88 / #5631259 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2415171",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "arrabbiati-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5403930",
          "text": "È perché siete arrabbiati?",
          "translation": "Вы поэтому рассержены?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5403930 @dnnywld / #5403900 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5403930",
