          "text": "Sei sotto sostanze?",
          "translation": "Ты под веществами?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10860397 @dnnywld / #4360506 @Ooneykcall (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10860397",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sostanze-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5650184",
          "text": "Vorrei sapere in che modo l'organismo assorbe queste sostanze.",
          "translation": "Хотелось бы знать, каким образом организм поглощает эти вещества.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5650184 @dnnywld / #5144280 @Karok (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5650184",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sostanze-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": "f",
        "singular": "la sostanze",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": ""
      }
