          "translation": "Ты ведь остаешься с Томом, да?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5974011 @dnnywld / #5971753 @sharptoothed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5974011",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "resterai-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5571215",
          "text": "Resterai qui per un po' di tempo?",
          "translation": "Ты побудешь здесь какое-то время?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5571215 @dnnywld / #5570590 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5571215",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
