          "id": "6051361",
          "text": "Lui non fuma più.",
          "translation": "Он больше не курит.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6051361 @dnnywld / #6051341 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6051361",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "fuma-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4890956",
          "text": "Tom non fuma sigarette.",
          "translation": "Том не курит сигареты.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4890956 @Guybrush88 / #5111339 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4890956",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "fuma-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5519276",
          "text": "Lui fuma tutto il tempo.",
          "translation": "Он всё время курил.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5519276 @dnnywld / #5518808 @Balamax (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5519276",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "fuma-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5386752",
          "text": "Non sapevi che Mary fuma?",
          "translation": "Ты разве не знал, что Мэри курит?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5386752 @dnnywld / #5386716 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5386752",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "fuma-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
