          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "seme-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6953723",
          "text": "Un piccole seme diventa un grande albero.",
          "translation": "Маленькое семечко становится большим деревом.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6953723 @dnnywld / #3828122 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6953723",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "seme-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2901915",
          "text": "Il seme della rivoluzione è la repressione.",
          "translation": "Семена революции — репрессии.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2901915 @Guybrush88 / #6137498 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2901915",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "seme-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
