          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "capiti-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6967924",
          "text": "Quanto spesso capiti a Boston?",
          "translation": "Как часто ты бываешь в Бостоне?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6967924 @dnnywld / #3616214 @mrtaistoi (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6967924",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "capiti-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6881603",
          "text": "Assumeremo che ci siamo capiti.",
          "translation": "Будем считать, что мы друг друга поняли.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6881603 @dnnywld / #5258513 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6881603",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "capiti-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
