          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13430340",
          "text": "Le mie armi sono l'ironia e il sarcasmo.",
          "translation": "Моё оружие - ирония и сарказм.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13430340 @carlosalberto / #13430287 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13430340",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ironia-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5791796",
          "text": "Tom non capisce né l'ironia, né il sarcasmo.",
          "translation": "Том не понимает ни иронии, ни сарказма.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5791796 @dnnywld / #5791253 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5791796",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ironia-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5496566",
          "text": "Ironia della sorte, l'autostrada di Kaluga non collega Mosca a Kaluga.",
          "translation": "Как ни странно, Калужское шоссе не ведёт из Москвы в Калугу.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5496566 @dnnywld / #5496504 @AqQoyriq_1 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5496566",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "ironia-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
