        {
          "id": "6585956",
          "text": "Vi è piaciuta l'esibizione?",
          "translation": "Вам понравилось представление?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6585956 @Guybrush88 / #2820962 @sharptoothed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6585956",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
