          "text": "Qui è importante l'estrema precisione.",
          "translation": "Тут важна исключительная точность.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6878034 @dnnywld / #6878009 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6878034",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "estrema-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2493801",
          "text": "Improvvisamente fui preso da un'estrema stanchezza.",
          "translation": "Внезапно меня охватила крайняя усталость.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2493801 @al_ex_an_der / #2493797 @al_ex_an_der (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2493801",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "estrema-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6878033",
          "text": "In questo caso la precisione estrema è importante.",
          "translation": "В этом деле важна исключительная точность.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6878033 @dnnywld / #6878010 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6878033",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "estrema-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "14082701",
          "text": "Gli schiavi venivano puniti con estrema severità per la minima infrazione.",
          "translation": "Рабов жестоко наказывали за малейшую провинность.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #14082701 @carlosalberto / #14082645 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/14082701",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "estrema-adj"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": "f",
        "singular": "la estrema",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": ""
      }
