          "source": "Tatoeba #5998835 @dnnywld / #4370849 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5998835",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "scesa-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5998836",
          "text": "Mary è scesa al suo livello.",
          "translation": "Мэри опустилась до его уровня.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5998836 @dnnywld / #4370852 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5998836",
