          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pulite-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3588049",
          "text": "Le tue mani sono pulite?",
          "translation": "У тебя чистые руки?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3588049 @Guybrush88 / #2605485 @Olya (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3588049",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pulite-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6961312",
          "text": "\"E le tue mani sono pulite?\" - \"Dubiti della pulizia delle mie mani?\".",
          "translation": "\"А руки у тебя чистые?\" — \"Ты сомневаешься в чистоте моих рук?\"",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6961312 @dnnywld / #6960478 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6961312",
