          "text": "Scrivete con l'inchiostro.",
          "translation": "Пишите чернилами.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6843129 @dnnywld / #5239944 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6843129",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
