          "text": "Sono riuscito ad occupare un buon posto.",
          "translation": "Я смог занять хорошее место.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5452812 @dnnywld / #638893 @Leopard (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5452812",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "occupare-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5452875",
          "text": "I fumatori sono pregati di occupare i posti dietro.",
          "translation": "Курильщиков попросили занять задние сиденья.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5452875 @dnnywld / #4186378 @Wezzel (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5452875",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "occupare-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": null,
        "singular": "occupare",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": "occupare"
      }
