          "id": "3269696",
          "text": "Perché stai cantando?",
          "translation": "Почему ты поёшь?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3269696 @Guybrush88 / #3308646 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3269696",
