          "source": "Tatoeba #10885188 @dnnywld / #6457653 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10885188",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "marmellata-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5669842",
          "text": "Mary sta preparando la marmellata.",
          "translation": "Мэри готовит варенье.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5669842 @dnnywld / #5669756 @Balamax (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5669842",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
