          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "seminario-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6946147",
          "text": "Chi vuole risolvere questo problema venga al seminario.",
          "translation": "Кто хочет разобраться в этой проблеме, приходите на семинар.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6946147 @dnnywld / #6946112 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6946147",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "seminario-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5647691",
          "text": "La preparazione per il seminario richiede molto tempo e tanta fatica.",
          "translation": "Подготовка к семинару требует много времени и труда.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5647691 @dnnywld / #5647603 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5647691",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "seminario-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
