          "id": "6325209",
          "text": "La tua analisi è corretta.",
          "translation": "Твой анализ верен.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6325209 @Guybrush88 / #6461172 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6325209",
