          "source": "Tatoeba #5862135 @dnnywld / #5861982 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5862135",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "vicinato-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5443196",
          "text": "I bambini del vicinato lo amavano molto.",
          "translation": "Соседская детвора его очень любила.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5443196 @dnnywld / #5442422 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5443196",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
