          "id": "5515798",
          "text": "Scendete alla prossima fermata.",
          "translation": "Выходите на следующей остановке.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5515798 @dnnywld / #5515654 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5515798",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "scendete-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7015491",
          "text": "Appena scendete dalla metro, telefonate.",
          "translation": "Как выйдете из метро, позвоните.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7015491 @dnnywld / #7015147 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7015491",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "scendete-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5515737",
          "text": "Per favore, scendete alla prossima fermata.",
          "translation": "Пожалуйста, сойдите на следующей остановке.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5515737 @dnnywld / #5515674 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5515737",
