          "word_slugs": [
            "preparata-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6691629",
          "text": "Mi sono preparata cinque giorni per l'esame.",
          "translation": "Я готовилась к экзамену пять дней.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6691629 @dnnywld / #6690683 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6691629",
