        },
        {
          "id": "5576893",
          "text": "Voglio andare a Napoli.",
          "translation": "Я хочу поехать в Неаполь.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5576893 @dnnywld / #3943171 @Balamax (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5576893",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "napoli-name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5535514",
          "text": "Dato che siete in Italia, dovete vedere Napoli.",
          "translation": "Раз уж вы в Италии, вам надо увидеть Неаполь.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5535514 @dnnywld / #5302580 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5535514",
