        },
        {
          "id": "12718697",
          "text": "Si assomigliano quanto due gocce d'acqua.",
          "translation": "Они похожи как две капли воды.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12718697 @Bernie75 / #3842625 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12718697",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "gocce-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7430884",
          "text": "Le prime gocce di pioggia cominciarono a martellare sul tetto.",
          "translation": "По крыше застучали первые капли дождя.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7430884 @dnnywld / #7430541 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7430884",
