        {
          "id": "5480229",
          "text": "Lui sta migliorando.",
          "translation": "Ему становится лучше.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5480229 @dnnywld / #799913 @vest (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5480229",
