          "text": "Chi lo ha tradotto?",
          "translation": "Кто это переводил?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10825614 @dnnywld / #7249603 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10825614",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "tradotto-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3800907",
          "text": "Non avete tradotto dal francese.",
          "translation": "Вы не перевели с французского.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3800907 @Guybrush88 / #6862717 @Balamax (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3800907",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "tradotto-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6488918",
          "text": "Quante pagine hai tradotto oggi?",
          "translation": "Сколько страниц ты сегодня перевела?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6488918 @dnnywld / #6488656 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6488918",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "tradotto-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "10825572",
          "text": "Caso mai, non ho tradotto io.",
          "translation": "Если что, переводил не я.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10825572 @dnnywld / #7249617 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10825572",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "tradotto-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "10908546",
          "text": "Non ho tradotto una singola frase.",
          "translation": "Я не перевёл ни одного предложения.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10908546 @dnnywld / #10908236 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10908546",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "tradotto-adj"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
