          "text": "Dov'è il bancomat più vicino?",
          "translation": "Где ближайший банкомат?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5676711 @dnnywld / #5676669 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5676711",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "bancomat-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5387011",
          "text": "Posso bloccare la mia carta bancomat?",
          "translation": "Могу я заблокировать свою банковскую карту?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5387011 @dnnywld / #5387007 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5387011",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "bancomat-noun"
          ]
        }
