          "text": "Sono allergico al mais.",
          "translation": "У меня аллергия на кукурузу.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4461363 @Guybrush88 / #4429482 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4461363",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
