          "id": "5505836",
          "text": "Quando è cominciata?",
          "translation": "Когда она началась?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5505836 @dnnywld / #5505457 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5505836",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "cominciata-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3333221",
          "text": "La giornata è cominciata male.",
          "translation": "День начался плохо.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3333221 @bailujia / #3333224 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3333221",
