          "word_slugs": [
            "pratico-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5510987",
          "text": "Sono un tipo poco pratico.",
          "translation": "Я непрактичный человек.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5510987 @dnnywld / #5510542 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5510987",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "pratico-adj"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3022917",
          "text": "In questo modo è molto più pratico.",
          "translation": "Так намного практичнее.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3022917 @al_ex_an_der / #3023015 @al_ex_an_der (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3022917",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
