          "translation": "Я только что вернулся из Великобритании.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5571248 @dnnywld / #5570483 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5571248",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "bretagna-name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7455267",
          "text": "Lui se n'è andato in Gran Bretagna.",
          "translation": "Он поехал в Великобританию.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7455267 @dnnywld / #7453523 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7455267",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "bretagna-name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6786333",
          "text": "La Gran Bretagna sta abbandonando l'Unione Europea.",
          "translation": "Британия покидает Евросоюз.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6786333 @dnnywld / #5497745 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6786333",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "bretagna-name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6871491",
          "text": "Noi due siamo andati in Bretagna per qualche giorno.",
          "translation": "Мы вдвоём поехали в Бретань на несколько дней.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6871491 @dnnywld / #521625 @zmoo (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6871491",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "bretagna-name"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": "f",
        "singular": "la Bretagna",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": ""
      }
