        {
          "id": "5499675",
          "text": "Tom non conosce la differenza tra una sigaretta e un sigaro.",
          "translation": "Том не знает, какая разница между сигаретой и сигарой.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5499675 @dnnywld / #5499011 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5499675",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sigaro-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5621086",
          "text": "Lui spense il sigaro nel portacenere e si alzò per andarsene.",
          "translation": "Он загасил сигару в пепельнице и поднялся, чтобы уйти.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5621086 @dnnywld / #5621054 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5621086",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "sigaro-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
