        {
          "id": "839623",
          "text": "Qual è il tuo gruppo sanguigno?",
          "translation": "Какая у тебя группа крови?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #839623 @riccioberto / #645338 @shanghainese (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/839623",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
