          "id": "4251435",
          "text": "L'ameba è un organismo unicellulare.",
          "translation": "Амёба - одноклеточный организм.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4251435 @Adelpa / #4251364 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4251435",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "organismo-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6559772",
          "text": "Il linguaggio è un organismo vivente.",
          "translation": "Язык - это живой организм.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6559772 @Guybrush88 / #6560114 @Selena777 (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6559772",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "organismo-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2206952",
          "text": "Questi parassiti si riproducono nell'organismo umano.",
          "translation": "Эти паразиты размножаются в организме человека.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2206952 @al_ex_an_der / #2206965 @al_ex_an_der (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2206952",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "organismo-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2056782",
          "text": "Un organismo unicellulare è costituito da una sola cellula.",
          "translation": "Одноклеточный организм состоит только из одной клетки.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2056782 @al_ex_an_der / #2056777 @al_ex_an_der (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2056782",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "organismo-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5650184",
          "text": "Vorrei sapere in che modo l'organismo assorbe queste sostanze.",
          "translation": "Хотелось бы знать, каким образом организм поглощает эти вещества.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5650184 @dnnywld / #5144280 @Karok (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5650184",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "organismo-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "C1"
      ],
      "source": "Kaikki it (CC BY-SA 4.0); examples: Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)",
      "verified": true,
      "italian": {
        "gender": "m",
        "singular": "il organismo",
        "plural": "",
        "infinitive": ""
      }
