          "text": "Dai torna qui, mascalzone!",
          "translation": "А ну вернись, подлец!",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5494771 @dnnywld / #5494668 @sharptoothed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5494771",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "mascalzone-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6673230",
          "text": "No, ma che razza di mascalzone!",
          "translation": "Нет, но каков подлец!",
          "source": "Tatoeba #6673230 @dnnywld / #6672986 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/6673230",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "mascalzone-noun"
          ]
        }
      ],
