          "text": "Hanno già annunciato l'atterraggio?",
          "translation": "Посадку уже объявили?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10766216 @dnnywld / #7009837 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10766216",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "annunciato-name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "11371005",
          "text": "Ha annunciato il nome del vincitore.",
          "translation": "Он объявил имя победителя.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #11371005 @Bernie75 / #4485310 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/11371005",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "annunciato-name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5484106",
          "text": "Tom e Mary oggi hanno annunciato il loro fidanzamento.",
          "translation": "Том и Мэри сегодня объявили о своей помолвке.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5484106 @dnnywld / #5483977 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5484106",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "annunciato-name"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5565973",
          "text": "L'imperatore del Giappone Akihito ha annunciato la sua intenzione di abdicare.",
          "translation": "Император Японии Акихито объявил о намерении отречься от престола.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5565973 @dnnywld / #5565953 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5565973",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "annunciato-name"
          ]
        }
      ],
