          "source": "Tatoeba #3352110 @Guybrush88 / #6874591 @nina99nv (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3352110",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "svenire-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3352076",
          "text": "Faceva così caldo che pensavo di svenire.",
          "translation": "Было так жарко, что я думала, что упаду в обморок.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3352076 @Guybrush88 / #2738644 @afyodor (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3352076",
